msgid "Inheritance"
msgstr "继承"

msgid "This chapter delves into the concept of inheritance, a fundamental aspect of object-oriented programming where classes inherit properties from other classes. Through inheritance, we achieve enhanced code reusability and improved modularity, streamlining the development process and fostering more efficient programming practices."
msgstr "本章深入探讨继承这一概念。继承是面向对象编程的基本特性之一，类可以从其他类继承属性。通过继承，我们可以提高代码的可复用性和模块化程度，简化开发过程，并促进更高效的编程实践。"

